# Morph image copies named paths only. Event Logs uses formx/Dockerfile.dockerignore
# for its own image, so a formx line here only drops Event Logs from the Morph
# context. Content Maker and Data Access use this same root ignore (context .).
# Keep the words composerx and SharpReport. Do not exclude those trees.
formx
